$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Tombaugh V" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Raining" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other two years after the last slaughter on this field.  Both teams have learned from the last battle and have bulked up their defenses and are ready to outfight their opponent.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base, touching it to their own flag to capture.  The flags are located on top of a floating platform that extends from their tower.  The first team with eight captures shall be the victor!";